      "id": "claim_5f488cd4e3974aa8ba80fdadd2f37ed3",
      "statement": "OpenVerifiers' two content sources (domain knowledge vs. target/input context) match the DL TBox/ABox split, and the verifier keeps OWA at its structural layer rather than drifting into DB-style CWA.",
